{"suttaId":"thag7.5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2100,2127],"vripara":"487"},"segments":{"thag7.5:0.4":"Sarabhaṅgattheragāthā","thag7.5:1.1":"“Sare hatthehi bhañjitvā,","thag7.5:1.2":"katvāna kuṭimacchisaṃ;","thag7.5:1.3":"Tena me sarabhaṅgoti,","thag7.5:1.4":"nāmaṃ sammutiyā ahu. 488.","thag7.5:2.1":"“Na mayhaṃ kappate ajja,","thag7.5:2.2":"sare hatthehi bhañjituṃ;","thag7.5:2.3":"Sikkhāpadā no paññattā,","thag7.5:2.4":"gotamena yasassinā. 489.","thag7.5:3.1":"“Sakalaṃ samattaṃ rogaṃ,","thag7.5:3.2":"sarabhaṅgo nāddasaṃ pubbe;","thag7.5:3.3":"Soyaṃ rogo diṭṭho,","thag7.5:3.4":"vacanakarenātidevassa. 490.","thag7.5:4.1":"“Yeneva maggena gato vipassī,","thag7.5:4.2":"yeneva maggena sikhī ca vessabhū;","thag7.5:4.3":"Kakusandhakoṇāgamano ca kassapo,","thag7.5:4.4":"tenañjasena agamāsi gotamo. 491.","thag7.5:5.1":"“Vītataṇhā anādānā,","thag7.5:5.2":"satta buddhā khayogadhā;","thag7.5:5.3":"Yehāyaṃ desito dhammo,","thag7.5:5.4":"dhammabhūtehi tādibhi. 492.","thag7.5:6.1":"“Cattāri ariyasaccāni,","thag7.5:6.2":"anukampāya pāṇinaṃ;","thag7.5:6.3":"Dukkhaṃ samudayo maggo,","thag7.5:6.4":"nirodho dukkhasaṅkhayo. 493.","thag7.5:7.1":"“Yasmiṃ nivattate [yasmiṃ na nibbattate (ka.)] dukkhaṃ,","thag7.5:7.2":"saṃsārasmiṃ anantakaṃ;","thag7.5:7.3":"Bhedā imassa kāyassa,","thag7.5:7.4":"jīvitassa ca saṅkhayā;","thag7.5:7.5":"Añño punabbhavo natthi,","thag7.5:7.6":"suvimuttomhi sabbadhī”ti. …","thag7.5:7.7":"Sarabhaṅgo thero….","thag7.5:7.8":"Sattakanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag7.5:8.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag7.5:8.1":"Sundarasamuddo thero,","thag7.5:8.2":"thero lakuṇḍabhaddiyo;","thag7.5:8.3":"Bhaddo thero ca sopāko,","thag7.5:8.4":"sarabhaṅgo mahāisi;","thag7.5:8.5":"Sattake pañcakā therā,","thag7.5:8.6":"gāthāyo pañcatiṃsatīti. 8."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":1775,"to":1799,"paras":[{"para":1775,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:2"],"lines":["<b>Na mayhaṃ kappate ajjā</b>ti ajja idāni upasampannassa mayhaṃ <b>sare</b> saratiṇe hatthehi bhañjituṃ na kappate na vaṭṭati.","Kasmā?","<b>Sikkhāpadā no paññattā, gotamena yasassinā</b>ti.","Tena yaṃ amhākaṃ satthārā sikkhāpadaṃ paññattaṃ, taṃ mayaṃ jīvitahetunāpi nātikkamāmāti dasseti."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:2"],["thag7.5:2"],["thag7.5:2"],["thag7.5:2"]]},{"para":1776,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:2"],"lines":["Evaṃ ekena pakārena tiṇakuṭikāya apaṭisaṅkharaṇe kāraṇaṃ dassetvā idāni aparenapi pariyāyena naṃ dassento – 489."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:2"]]},{"para":1778,"vripara":"489","refs":["thag7.5:2"],"lines":["“Sakalaṃ samattaṃ rogaṃ, sarabhaṅgo nāddasaṃ pubbe;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:2"]]},{"para":1779,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:2"],"lines":["Soyaṃ rogo diṭṭho, vacanakarenātidevassā”ti. –","imaṃ gāthamāha;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:2"],["thag7.5:2"]]},{"para":1780,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Tattha <b>sakala</b>nti sabbaṃ.","<b>Samatta</b>nti sampuṇṇaṃ, sabbabhāgato anavasesanti attho.","<b>Roga</b>nti dukkhadukkhatādivasena rujanaṭṭhena rogabhūtaṃ upādānakkhandhapañcakaṃ sandhāya vadati.","<b>Nāddasaṃ pubbe</b>ti satthu ovādapaṭilābhato pubbe na addakkhiṃ.","<b>Soyaṃ rogo diṭṭho, vacanakarenātidevassā</b>ti sammutidevā upapattidevā visuddhidevāti sabbepi deve attano sīlādiguṇehi atikkamitvā ṭhitattā atidevassa sammāsambuddhassa ovādapaṭikarena sarabhaṅgena so ayaṃ khandhapañcakasaṅkhāto rogo vipassanāpaññāsahitāya maggapaññāya pañcakkhandhato diṭṭho, pariññātoti attho.","Etena evaṃ attabhāvakuṭikāyampi anapekkho bāhiraṃ tiṇakuṭikaṃ kathaṃ paṭisaṅkharissatīti dasseti."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1781,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Idāni yaṃ maggaṃ paṭipajjantena mayā ayaṃ attabhāvarogo yāthāvato diṭṭho, svāyaṃ maggo sabbabuddhasādhāraṇo.","Yena nesaṃ ovādadhammopi majjhe bhinnasuvaṇṇasadiso yatthāhaṃ patiṭṭhāya dukkhakkhayaṃ pattoti evaṃ attano arahattapaṭipattiṃ byākaronto – 490."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1783,"vripara":"490","refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["“Yeneva maggena gato vipassī, yeneva maggena sikhī ca vessabhū;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1784,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Kakusandhakoṇāgamano ca kassapo, tenañjasena agamāsi gotamo. 491."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1786,"vripara":"491","refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["“Vītataṇhā anādānā, satta buddhā khayogadhā;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1787,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Yehāyaṃ desito dhammo, dhammabhūtehi tādibhi. 492."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1789,"vripara":"492","refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["“Cattāri ariyasaccāni, anukampāya pāṇinaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1790,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Dukkhaṃ samudayo maggo, nirodho dukkhasaṅkhayo. 493."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1792,"vripara":"493","refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["“Yasmiṃ nivattate dukkhaṃ, saṃsārasmiṃ anantakaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1793,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Bhedā imassa kāyassa, jīvitassa ca saṅkhayā;"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1794,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Añño punabbhavo natthi, suvimuttomhi sabbadhī”ti. –"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1795,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Imā gāthā abhāsi –"],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1796,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["Tattha <b>yeneva maggenā</b>ti yeneva sapubbabhāgena ariyena aṭṭhaṅgikena maggena.","<b>Gato</b>ti paṭipanno nibbānaṃ adhigato.","<b>Vipassī</b>ti vipassī sammāsambuddho.","<b>Kakusandhā</b>ti avibhattiko niddeso.","“Kakusandhakoṇāgamanā”tipi pāṭho.","<b>Tenañjasenā</b>ti teneva añjasena ariyamaggena."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1797,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3"],"lines":["<b>Anādānā</b>ti anupādānā appaṭisandhikā vā.","<b>Khayogadhā</b>ti nibbānogadhā nibbānapatiṭṭhā.","<b>Yehāyaṃ desito dhammo</b>ti yehi sattahi sammāsambuddhehi ayaṃ sāsanadhammo desito pavedito.","<b>Dhammabhūtehī</b>ti dhammakāyatāya dhammasabhāvehi, navalokuttaradhammato vā bhūtehi jātehi, dhammaṃ vā pattehi.","<b>Tādibhī</b>ti, iṭṭhādīsu tādibhāvappattehi."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"]]},{"para":1798,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:3","thag7.5:7"],"lines":["<b>“Cattāri</b> <b>ariyasaccānī”</b>tiādinā tehi desitaṃ dhammaṃ dasseti.","Tattha <b>cattārī</b>ti gaṇanaparicchedo.","<b>Ariyasaccānī</b>ti paricchinnadhammadassanaṃ.","Vacanatthato pana ariyāni ca avitathaṭṭhena saccāni cāti ariyasaccāni, ariyassa vā bhagavato saccāni tena desitattā, ariyabhāvakarāni vā saccānīti ariyasaccāni.","Kucchitabhāvato tucchabhāvato ca <b>dukkhaṃ,</b> upādānakkhandhapañcakaṃ.","Taṃ dukkhaṃ samudeti etasmāti <b>samudayo,</b> taṇhā.","Kilese mārento gacchati, nibbānatthikehi maggīyatīti vā <b>maggo,</b> sammādiṭṭhiādayo aṭṭha dhammā.","Saṃsāracārakasaṅkhāto natthi ettha rodho, etasmiṃ vā adhigate puggalassa rodhābhāvo hoti, nirujjhati dukkhametthāti vā <b>nirodho,</b> nibbānaṃ.","Tenāha “dukkhasaṅkhayo”ti.","Ayamettha saṅkhepo, vitthāro pana <b>visuddhimagge</b> vuttanayeneva veditabbo."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:3"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"]]},{"para":1799,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag7.5:7"],"lines":["<b>Yasmi</b>nti yasmiṃ nirodhe nibbāne adhigate.","<b>Nivattate</b>ti ariyamaggabhāvanāya sati <b>anantakaṃ</b> apariyantaṃ imasmiṃ saṃsāre jātiādidukkhaṃ na pavattati ucchijjati, so nirodhoti ayaṃ dhammabhūtehi sammāsambuddhehi desito dhammoti yojanā.","<b>“Bhedā”</b>tiādinā “rogo diṭṭho”ti dukkhapariññāya sūcitaṃ attano arahattappattiṃ sarūpato dasseti.","“Yasmiṃ nibbattate dukkha”nti pana pāṭhe sakalagāthāya tatthāyaṃ yojanā – <b>yasmiṃ</b> khandhādipaṭipāṭisaññite saṃsāre idaṃ anantakaṃ jātiādidukkhaṃ nibbattaṃ, so ito dukkhappattito añño punappunaṃ bhavanabhāvato punabbhavo.","Imassa jīvitindriyassa saṅkhayā kāyasaṅkhātassa khandhapañcakassa bhedā vināsā uddhaṃ natthi, tasmā sabbadhi sabbehi kilesehi sabbehi bhavehi suṭṭhu vimutto visaṃyutto amhīti."],"lineRefs":[["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"],["thag7.5:7"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag7.5:2.1","na mayhaṃ kappate ajjā",0,0],["thag7.5:2.1","sare",0,0],["thag7.5:2.3","sikkhāpadā no paññattā gotamena yasassinā",0,2],["thag7.5:3.1","sakalaṃ",4,0],["thag7.5:3.1","samattaṃ",4,1],["thag7.5:3.1","rogaṃ",4,2],["thag7.5:3.1","nāddasaṃ pubbe",4,3],["thag7.5:3.3","soyaṃ rogo diṭṭho vacanakarenātidevassā",4,4],["thag7.5:7.1","dukkhaṃ",18,4],["thag7.5:7.1","yasmiṃ",19,0],["thag7.5:7.1","anantakaṃ",19,1],["thag7.5:7.1","nivattate",19,1],["thag7.5:7.3","bhedā",19,2],["thag7.5:7.1","yasmiṃ",19,3]],"after":[{"para":1800,"vripara":null,"title":"Sarabhaṅgattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sarabhaṅgattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]},{"para":1801,"vripara":null,"title":"Sarabhaṅgattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sattakanipātavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 8."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
